'''Coral''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{Zone|Red House}}. They task the player with collecting varieties of [[The Fish Family]] in exchange for {{Skill|Fishing}} experience, {{SkyBlock Experience}}, and {{Stat|Respiration}}.

== UI ==
{{/UI}}

== Purpose ==
'''Coral''' rewards players with {{Skill|Fishing}} experience, {{SkyBlock Experience}}, and {{Stat|Respiration}} for making their [[The Fish (disambiguation)|Fish]] {{Soulbound|Co-op}}.

The first 15 fish grant {{SkyBlock XP|+3}}, for a total of up to {{SkyBlock XP|+45}}. Each fish also grants {{Stat|Respiration|+2}}, as well as increasing amounts of {{Skill|Fishing}} XP.
