== Trivia ==
* Although {{Item|Chill the Fish|text=Chill}}, {{Item|Egg the Fish|text=Egg}}, {{Item|Oops the Fish|text=Oops}},{{Item|Spook the Fish|text=Spook}} and {{Item Display|Singing Fish!Singing}} count as part of The Fish Family, '''Coral''' does not reward the player for showing those obtained from fishing in the Main Lobby of Hypixel or from [[Carnival]] rewards.
* The {{Skill|Fishing}} XP gained from '''Coral''' is not affected by {{stat|Fishing Wisdom}}.

